extends ../layouts/base

block content
  main.flex-1.flex.items-center.justify-center.px-4.py-16
    .max-w-xl.w-full.bg-white.rounded-2xl.p-8.border.border-slate-100.shadow-sm.text-center.space-y-4
      h1.text-3xl.font-extrabold.tracking-tight
        span.text-brand-blue Skill
        span.text-brand-green Swap
      p.text-slate-600.text-sm
        | Teach what you know, learn what you want, and earn points along the way.
      .flex.items-center.justify-center.gap-3.pt-2
        a(class='px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-blue text-white text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-brand-blue-hover transition-colors' href='/register') Create account
        a(class='px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors' href='/login') Log in
